{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>西營盤恆輝大廈起火。(網上圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>西營盤發生火警。今日(19日)晚上8時許，薄扶林道22至32號恆輝大廈中層一個單位起火。消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊將火救熄。火警中，初步一名70多歲老翁昏迷，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救。大批居民疏散至樓下暫避。警方及消防現正調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:20:01.695876+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:31:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:46.259164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:46.259164+00:00","content_hash":"01fea81912dc8dd73a7345d1831537c8e2b656c37addbd54c6357b5316ec2ce9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}